'''Adrenaline''' is a Survive-tree passive that scales with level; the table above shows the exact effect at each of its 8 ranks.

== Effect ==

The attack that first reduces HP below 
[ *% ] triggers the Adrenaline effect.

Melee damage + [ *% ],
Stamina consumption - [ *% ],
Super Armor Chance + [ *% ],
Water consumption + [ *% ],

for [ * ] seconds.

[ Super Armor ]: When struck, has a chance to gain this effect, immune to action interruption and knockdown from attacks.

